    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c025_lu_qingcang_p030",
      "act_id": "act2_cliffside_wine_father_son_pact",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "lu_qingcang",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "[fiercely] [dramatically] 真要是在对面撞上哪路元婴老魔，人家打不过你，顺手把老子抓去架在脖子上逼你束手就擒，我陆擎苍就算当场咬舌自尽都嫌丢尽了一世英名！",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.0,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "dry",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.32,
      "director_note": "陆擎苍虎目认真，宁死不受胁迫累及儿子"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c026_nar_p031",
      "act_id": "act2_cliffside_wine_father_son_pact",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "说到这里，陆擎苍站起身望向身后万家灯火初上、炊烟袅袅升起的三千里苍翠新大陆，眼中满是铁血统帅的担当：",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "dry",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.28,
      "director_note": "旁白叙事（声场：dry）"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c027_lu_qingcang_p032",
      "act_id": "act2_cliffside_wine_father_son_pact",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "lu_qingcang",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "[calmly] [dramatically] 更何况，这座新大陆刚从万丈海底升起来，上百万拔了妖骨的苦海修士跟刚学走路的娃娃没两样，还有跟着爹从北渊天渊、永夜皇城一路九死一生杀出来的两百多号老弱弟兄，总得有一把硬刀留下来替他们镇住场子！",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "dry",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.32,
      "director_note": "陆擎苍回望万家灯火的新大陆展现铁血统帅担当"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c028_lu_qingcang_p033",
      "act_id": "act2_cliffside_wine_father_son_pact",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "lu_qingcang",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "[dramatically] [fiercely] 爹就留在【镇渊城】当这个守城人，一面把这颗古法金丹一步步打磨到九转圆满，一面替你练出一支不拜伪仙的无骨铁军，给你小子守死这条跨界退路！",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.0,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "dry",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.32,
      "director_note": "陆擎苍立约留守镇渊城练出无骨铁军守死退路"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c029_nar_p034",
      "act_id": "act2_cliffside_wine_father_son_pact",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "[dramatically] 海风吹动着父亲空荡的左袖，猎猎作响，带着北渊风雪特有的凛冽豪气。陆烬静静听完，心中流淌过一股深沉滚烫的暖流。陆烬比谁都清楚，修行越往高处，每一个大境界的鸿沟便越是天堑，第四界【太虚画壁界】不仅有元婴大修，背后更有【司命仙庭】的恐怖黑手，强行带着金丹初期的父亲同行确实凶险万分。父亲主动提出留守新陆，既全了这方新生天地的苍生大义，更是为了让他能够毫无后顾之忧地孤身拔刀、放手杀穿前路！真正生死相托的硬汉父子，从不需要半句矫情的拉扯推让。",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.0,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "dry",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.28,
      "director_note": "旁白叙事（声场：dry）"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c030_nar_p039",
      "act_id": "act2_cliffside_wine_father_son_pact",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "陆烬站起身，手指在暗金储物戒上一抹，取出整整三百块极品【深海万年灵髓】、二十瓶三阶疗伤破境宝丹、五套三阶护城大阵阵旗，以及一枚他昨夜亲手刻录的《周天星窍战诀》简化炼体玉简，一并放在青石案上：",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "dry",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.28,
      "director_note": "旁白叙事（声场：dry）"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c031_lu_jin_p040",
      "act_id": "act2_cliffside_wine_father_son_pact",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "lu_jin",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "[calmly] 好，这片归墟新陆与诸界退路，便交给爹坐镇。若有外海残孽不开眼，爹只管拿三阶护城大阵与【镇岳】阔刀劈了便是。",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "dry",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.32,
      "director_note": "陆烬留下万年灵髓、护城阵旗与星窍玉简托付父亲"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c032_nar_p041",
      "act_id": "act2_cliffside_wine_father_son_pact",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "陆烬端起粗陶酒碗，看着比四年前苍老却愈发精神矍铄的养父，一字一句郑重道。",
